Match the rk817-clkout child that the BSP MFD creates for RK809 and
RK817. The clock driver's platform ID table takes precedence over its
driver name and did not match this child. The driver already selects
the RK817 clock operations for both PMIC variants.

--- a/drivers/clk/clk-rk808.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/clk-rk808.c
@@ -205,6 +205,7 @@
 	{ "rk809-clk", 0 },
 	{ "rk816-clk", 0 },
 	{ "rk817-clk", 0 },
+	{ "rk817-clkout", 0 },
 	{ "rk818-clk", 0 },
 	{ }
 };
